# Replaces the undeliverable/broadcast TakeClientReady SIGNAL with a proactive
# TakeClient METHOD call held open by the system daemon until the client reconnects.
# Includes audit hardening: S1 (reset take_client_requested per handover cycle) and
# a guard against orphaning an already-pending TakeClient invocation.
# PRECONDITION: correct for the rdstls path (use_system_credentials == FALSE), i.e.
# guacd/FreeRDP and rdstls-capable mstsc. A legacy mstsc NOT requesting rdstls sets
# use_system_credentials=TRUE and would need the GetSystemCredentials step this
# proactive path skips -- out of scope for this deployment.
